title: Whiteboard
description: The canvas (React Flow). Boxes, text nodes, nestable groups, pictures and videos, and styled arrows. Any of them can hold a page or a whole whiteboard of its own.
color: teal
connects:
  - to: src/lib/whiteboard
    label: reads and writes the whiteboard
  - to: src/lib/sync
    label: live updates and cursors
  - to: src/components/editor
    label: descriptions in the side panel
